            "description": "Server-rendered Google Static Maps PNG with a pin for the origin and one per nearby investable, labeled by ticker. Proxies the request so `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` never reaches a widget extension (see docs/SECRETS.md). Returns 501 when no key is configured."
